  "briefing": {
    "blurb": "Fairfax Regional folded overnight and IMI holds the paper. Empty the branch, vault included, before the regulators arrive.",
    "hazards": [
      "Two inspectors patrol the lobby, teller line and back corridor",
      "The vault door is locked steel",
      "The server and safe-deposit rooms are sealed behind drywall"
    ]
  },
  "notes": "Credit union branch. Dock: 2-tile gap in the west lobby wall W of (4,8)-(4,9) onto the asphalt yard. Gated: VAULT (16..19,2..4) behind a locked steel door W of (16,4) (hp 300) off the manager office, other vault walls steel; SERVER room (4..5,2..4) sealed, breach drywall W of (6,3) from the back office or N of (4,5)/(5,5) from the lobby; SAFE-DEPOSIT room (16..19,5..7) sealed, breach drywall W of (16,6) from the back corridor or N of (17..19,8) from the break room. Grass ledge (4..11,0..1) under the 4 north back-office windows N of (6..9,2) is the catch-net zone.",
